6. Use the spark’s color (`s.col`) and the fade factor to set `ctx.strokeStyle` with appropriate alpha.
7. Scale the line width with `k` so that sparks shrink as they die.
8. Draw a line from the previous screen coordinate to the current one, then restore the canvas state.

